BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_01db200b-d3a9-4299-849c-b2c9bafa4916.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
